<span id="S2.T1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S2.T1.2.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Governance is handled by external systems</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S2.T1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="S2.T1.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
